translate schinese ep10_nora_date_label_00f7d4bc:

    # no "They aren't very important. Sure, it's nice to have something pretty to look at, but why bother if there's no substance behind the exterior?"
    no "它们并不那么重要。嗯，有漂亮的东西可看确实不错，但如果外表下没有实质，那又何必费劲呢？"

# episode10\branches\ep10_others_branch.rpy:1382
translate schinese ep10_nora_date_label_93cf8c65:

    # mc "Sure, but if you don't like what you're looking at, there's no way that substance will make up for it romantically."
    mc "当然，但如果你不喜欢看到的东西，再有内涵也补不回那份浪漫的感觉。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_others_branch.rpy:1384
