translate schinese ep10_nora_date_label_bad5c5de:

    # mc "I'm gonna say no. They aren't very important, but it doesn't hurt if you got them."
    mc "我得说不。它们不是很重要，但如果你有也是没关系的。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_others_branch.rpy:1394
translate schinese ep10_nora_date_label_e39e792b:

    # no "We seem to agree on this one, too. Are you just answering what you think will please me, or are you being honest?"
    no "我们在这点上也达成了共识。你是只在迎合我期望的答案，还是在说实话？"

