translate schinese ep10_nora_date_label_a4801df7:

    # mc "I'm being honest. Sure, it's nice to date someone as attractive as yourself, but if the talks are boring and you don't connect, looks won't matter in the long run."
    mc "我在说实话。说实话，和一个像你这样有吸引力的人约会确实不错，但如果聊天无聊，又没感觉，时间一长，外貌也就没那么重要了。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_others_branch.rpy:1398
translate schinese ep10_nora_date_label_0482fe3a:

    # no "We think the same about this. Color me impressed."
    no "我们在这点上看法一致。挺佩服你的。"

# episode10\branches\ep10_others_branch.rpy:1400
translate schinese ep10_nora_date_label_a4e34360:

    # mc "I'll take it up a notch..."
    mc "我得加点料了..."

